{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43129","headline":"塞上 · 郑渥","name":"塞上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出门何处问西东，指画翻爲语论同。\n到此客头潜觉白，未秋山叶已飘红。\n帐前影落传书鴈，日下声交失马翁。\n早晚回鞭复南去，大衣高盖汉乡风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑渥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43129.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43129","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}